WEBVTT

00:04.180 --> 00:09.810
I have always believed

00:10.190 --> 00:14.570
終わらない夢を握りしめて

00:10.190 --> 00:14.570
owaranai yume wo nigiri shimete

00:10.190 --> 00:14.570
in taking hold of that endless dream.

00:14.570 --> 00:17.860
TRUST ME MY WAY

00:27.580 --> 00:31.500
DON'T MIND 時にこの想い

00:27.580 --> 00:31.500
DON'T MIND toki ni kono omoi

00:27.580 --> 00:31.500
I don't mind... sometimes feeling like

00:31.500 --> 00:34.210
空回りするけど

00:31.500 --> 00:34.210
karamawari suru kedo

00:31.500 --> 00:34.210
I'm just spinning my wheels, but...

00:34.670 --> 00:37.880
‘ちょっとポジティブ’がいいんじゃない？

00:34.670 --> 00:37.880
chotto POJITIBU ga iinjanai

00:34.670 --> 00:37.880
Why don't you act a little more positive?

00:38.010 --> 00:41.600
自分らしいキャラでいい

00:38.010 --> 00:41.600
jibunrashii KYARA de ii

00:38.010 --> 00:41.600
You should be yourself.

00:41.720 --> 00:47.440
でもね... ハチャメチャなシナリオは

00:41.720 --> 00:47.440
demo nee... HACHAMECHA na SHINARIO wa

00:41.720 --> 00:47.440
But you know, a messed up scenario

00:49.100 --> 00:54.610
愛すべき 未来に変わって いく

00:49.100 --> 00:54.610
aisubeki asu ni kawatte iku

00:49.100 --> 00:54.610
will turn into a lovable tomorrow.

00:54.610 --> 00:56.110
TRUST MY WAY

00:56.150 --> 01:01.570
THE WIND 頬をなでる

00:56.150 --> 01:01.570
THE WIND hoho wo naderu

00:56.150 --> 01:01.570
The wind, it caresses my cheek.

01:01.830 --> 01:05.250
風と-緒に心地好く

01:01.830 --> 01:05.250
kaze to issho ni kokochiyoku

01:01.830 --> 01:05.250
Together with this comfortable breeze,

01:05.250 --> 01:10.130
楽しめる速度でこれからも

01:05.250 --> 01:10.130
tanoshimeru sokudo de kore kara mo

01:05.250 --> 01:10.130
and at a rate I also enjoy,

01:10.250 --> 01:15.760
ずっと変わらない想い

01:10.250 --> 01:15.760
zutto kawaranai omoi

01:10.250 --> 01:15.760
these feelings won't ever change.

01:16.010 --> 01:20.340
終わらない夢を握りしめて

01:16.010 --> 01:20.340
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

01:16.010 --> 01:20.340
I"m taking hold of that endless dream.

01:20.340 --> 01:23.970
TRUST ME MY WAY

01:38.100 --> 01:39.370
I received the report.

01:39.600 --> 01:40.590
It was of great interest.

01:41.020 --> 01:43.180
Yes. Continue investigating immediately.

01:43.840 --> 01:44.950
We've struck gold.

01:45.240 --> 01:48.900
Just as I thought... That Mitsuki, as diminutive as she may be,

01:49.230 --> 01:51.490
is not just a diminutive person.

01:54.000 --> 01:56.610
It's okay with me, Onee-chan.

01:56.680 --> 01:57.340
What is?

01:57.750 --> 02:00.280
Give Takami-san's contest a shot!

02:00.480 --> 02:03.090
Because it looks interesting?

02:03.270 --> 02:03.940
That's right.

02:04.050 --> 02:04.640
No!

02:04.860 --> 02:06.720
You're not just some random girl!

02:07.030 --> 02:10.470
I can't accept someone's proposal to use you as a prize, Mitsuki!

02:10.660 --> 02:12.930
I'm telling you this because it's my proposal.

02:13.190 --> 02:14.360
It'll be fine!

02:14.440 --> 02:16.010
I'm sure it'll work out somehow!

02:16.260 --> 02:19.410
You said the same thing when we first arrived at Yoshitaka's house.

02:19.660 --> 02:21.560
And thanks to that, I went through some horrific things!

02:21.710 --> 02:22.550
Really?

02:22.660 --> 02:24.050
But it was a lot of fun!

02:24.460 --> 02:26.640
You think anything is okay as long as it's fun, don't you?

02:27.180 --> 02:27.950
Oh, do I?

02:28.720 --> 02:33.260
Anyway, why do I have to be the one to get Yoshitaka's house back?

02:33.730 --> 02:36.060
He and I don't have anything to do with each other anymore.

02:36.640 --> 02:40.070
And besides, I usually end up digging my own grave at times like this,

02:40.370 --> 02:41.980
so it's best to do nothing.

02:42.540 --> 02:44.910
Nothing good happened when I was in that house.

02:45.640 --> 02:49.210
It's like I always had to watch my back.

02:49.290 --> 02:50.600
Izumi-saaan!

02:51.500 --> 02:52.200
A-Anna-cha-

02:53.070 --> 02:53.940
Anna-chan!

02:54.020 --> 02:55.650
You're feeling better already?

02:55.970 --> 02:57.180
Don't talk about such things!

02:57.340 --> 02:59.270
It's been a long time. Please wash me!

02:59.360 --> 03:00.200
Hey, Anna-chan!

03:00.270 --> 03:01.740
Haven't you recovered too quickly?

03:02.540 --> 03:06.460
Well, I'm not the type of person who worries about the small things in life, am I?

03:08.060 --> 03:10.020
Everyone is jealous of that personality.

03:10.110 --> 03:11.710
Mitsuki, I'm leaving her to you.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.860
Wash her enough for a week!

03:14.130 --> 03:14.860
All right!

03:15.540 --> 03:16.500
Ah, Izumi-san!

03:16.640 --> 03:17.210
What's with her?

03:17.300 --> 03:19.250
She was crying so hard this afternoon.

03:19.690 --> 03:20.980
That's not fair.

03:21.170 --> 03:23.680
Weren't you the first to leave, Izumi-san?

03:23.770 --> 03:24.870
It's unfair that you left.

03:25.090 --> 03:27.340
It's horrible that you left me there.

03:27.640 --> 03:28.700
I didn't have a choice.

03:29.140 --> 03:31.910
I know that I can't do anything with my own strength.

03:32.050 --> 03:33.600
I can't change anything!

03:34.110 --> 03:35.910
It's always been that way.

03:36.310 --> 03:39.810
But I didn't want to run away or give up any longer!

03:40.190 --> 03:41.790
That's why I went so far as to leave home!

03:45.330 --> 03:47.090
I don't know what to do anymore...

03:47.810 --> 03:49.180
What should I do?

03:49.960 --> 03:51.360
Tell me, God!

04:03.130 --> 04:04.220
Akahori Satou worked as a writer on the original manga and eventual GAINAX show "Magical Shopping Arcade Abenobashi."

04:03.470 --> 04:04.220
Yoshitaka!

04:03.470 --> 04:04.220
Deviant

04:03.470 --> 04:04.220
Akahori Satou

04:03.470 --> 04:04.220
Classification

04:03.470 --> 04:04.220
Pervert, Nakabayashi

04:03.470 --> 04:04.220
Solitary character

04:03.470 --> 04:04.220
Evil, Lecherous, No-Good

04:03.470 --> 04:04.220
Happy-go-lucky says

04:03.470 --> 04:04.220
Does as he wants

04:04.260 --> 04:05.470
Yoshitaka!

04:04.260 --> 04:05.470
Deviant

04:11.200 --> 04:13.040
All that thinking made me dizzy...

04:13.980 --> 04:14.680
Izumi-san!

04:14.820 --> 04:16.000
Onee-chan, it's serious!

04:18.020 --> 04:19.710
What's wrong, Mitsuki?

04:19.990 --> 04:20.850
And Anna-chan?

04:20.970 --> 04:22.310
Y-Yoshitaka-kun is...

04:24.320 --> 04:29.310
He is My Master!

04:30.190 --> 04:30.860
Yoshitaka!

04:31.710 --> 04:32.290
Hey.

04:32.540 --> 04:33.450
If it isn't Izumi!

04:33.590 --> 04:36.050
Yoshitaka... you look well.

04:36.540 --> 04:37.210
Yeah...

04:37.780 --> 04:38.960
I'm surprised, too.

04:39.640 --> 04:42.190
I don't know where I was or what I was doing myself.

04:42.800 --> 04:45.010
When I came to, I was lying here.

04:45.490 --> 04:48.570
Well, I guess you got to see an unsightly side of me.

04:49.600 --> 04:51.020
What's wrong with you?!

04:51.200 --> 04:52.710
I can't believe you would part with that house!

04:55.240 --> 04:59.240
That Takami... she's been scheming for my house.

04:59.750 --> 05:01.810
I was an idiot not to notice.

05:02.150 --> 05:03.500
That's all there is to it.

05:03.640 --> 05:04.970
"That's all there is to it"?

05:05.150 --> 05:07.290
Is it something you can give up so easily?!

05:07.540 --> 05:08.630
It's <i>your</i> house, isn't it?

05:09.490 --> 05:10.230
Get lost!

05:11.310 --> 05:13.200
Wh- But we're worried about you!

05:13.560 --> 05:16.390
You quit being my maid, didn't you?

05:17.030 --> 05:20.340
What do you plan to do by coming back to see someone you abandoned once?

05:20.860 --> 05:22.680
Leave me alone and get lost already.

05:22.980 --> 05:23.900
Yoshitaka...

05:24.600 --> 05:25.440
What happened?

05:25.850 --> 05:27.720
Did you hit your head somewhere or something?

05:28.130 --> 05:30.790
Or did you eat something strange you found laying around?

05:31.110 --> 05:34.350
I came to dislike myself greatly.

05:35.260 --> 05:37.700
I do nothing but selfish, loathsome things...

05:38.160 --> 05:41.420
The only way I can surround myself with people is to exploit their weaknesses.

05:41.630 --> 05:43.910
I knew it, but I couldn't do anything about it!

05:44.370 --> 05:46.780
Of course someone like me would be given up on.

05:47.480 --> 05:49.180
I'm supposed to be all alone!

05:49.550 --> 05:50.890
I have no right to complain!

05:51.150 --> 05:52.400
I'm sorry, Izumi.

05:52.760 --> 05:54.680
I was terrible, wasn't I?

05:55.150 --> 05:57.560
I'm grateful that you stayed with me as long as you did.

05:57.820 --> 05:58.810
It was a lot of fun!

05:59.460 --> 06:01.870
So... just leave me alone already!

06:03.370 --> 06:04.050
Shut up!

06:05.510 --> 06:06.720
What's with this self-despair?!

06:06.900 --> 06:08.190
You're Yoshitaka, aren't you?!

06:08.410 --> 06:10.880
I didn't think you would give up so easily!

06:11.250 --> 06:15.030
You were so tenacious it was disgusting. You even held grudges over the smallest things!

06:15.260 --> 06:18.150
Why are you acting like a normal, boring person at a critical time like this?!

06:18.860 --> 06:21.430
It's the house where so many of your precious things have been collected, right?

06:21.730 --> 06:23.660
Put your life on the line and get it back!

06:23.870 --> 06:27.690
But even if you win, things won't be the same!

06:27.940 --> 06:30.510
Remember that, you perverted, brutish dumbass!

06:31.280 --> 06:32.930
I see... I'm sorry.

06:33.040 --> 06:33.960
I'm glad you understand.

06:35.560 --> 06:38.560
I was challenged to a match by Takami-san.

06:38.830 --> 06:40.690
For Mitsuki and that mansion.

06:41.390 --> 06:45.440
I hadn't planned on it, but I've decided to accept that challenge!

06:45.730 --> 06:47.280
I'm sorry, Mitsuki.

06:48.010 --> 06:50.070
But I swear I won't lose!

06:50.260 --> 06:51.490
Yeah, it's all right!

06:51.770 --> 06:56.340
I'd be happy if everyone could live in that mansion again!

06:56.670 --> 06:57.970
No, Anna-chan.

06:58.380 --> 07:01.910
I'm not doing this contest because I want to return to that house.

07:02.440 --> 07:04.350
I won't run away anymore.

07:05.000 --> 07:06.220
I've decided!

07:09.710 --> 07:12.120
Are you prepared, Izumi-san?

07:12.300 --> 07:13.940
Oh, Yoshitaka is with you?

07:14.050 --> 07:15.240
You look surprisingly well.

07:15.330 --> 07:16.250
Mind your own business!

07:16.490 --> 07:17.720
I accept your challenge!

07:17.920 --> 07:19.940
But I won't hand Mitsuki over to anyone!

07:20.090 --> 07:21.860
Oh, my. How gallant of you.

07:22.470 --> 07:26.670
But are you even aware of that girl's true worth?

07:26.940 --> 07:29.800
Using a research consortium funded at my own expense,

07:29.960 --> 07:32.540
I was able to thoroughly investigate that girl.

07:32.850 --> 07:35.230
Analysis revealed that Sawatari Mitsuki is worth enough financially

07:35.340 --> 07:38.070
to purchase not only this mansion but also the surrounding area

07:38.280 --> 07:41.210
with a great deal of money left over!

07:41.430 --> 07:42.410
That much?

07:43.230 --> 07:44.800
So that's why you want Mitsuki?!

07:44.940 --> 07:46.800
Please don't talk about people like they're objects!

07:47.100 --> 07:48.520
And you, were you aware of that?

07:48.950 --> 07:53.820
In the end, you're arguing with me in some way or another thanks to that girl.

07:54.510 --> 07:57.100
Honestly, you're raising quite a fuss over this!

07:57.100 --> 07:57.740
That's...

07:59.560 --> 08:01.630
It's all right, Onee-chan.

08:01.730 --> 08:02.550
Mitsuki...

08:04.990 --> 08:05.570
All right!

08:05.850 --> 08:08.060
Well then, I have a proposal.

08:08.140 --> 08:08.920
What is it?

08:09.370 --> 08:13.100
Please let me, the person in question, decide upon the content of this match.

08:13.320 --> 08:14.220
Oh, I see.

08:14.470 --> 08:15.610
Well, all right.

08:16.110 --> 08:18.360
I'll agree to anything you like.

08:18.500 --> 08:22.800
Meeting boys, reading poetry, taking intelligence tests, playing sports, having manners, and courtesy modeling...

08:22.800 --> 08:26.120
I have been called a jack-of-all-trades!

08:26.600 --> 08:28.370
So, what kind of contest will it be?

08:29.060 --> 08:30.300
Let's see...

08:31.150 --> 08:32.390
What's all this?

08:32.620 --> 08:34.740
Rubbish that came from this mansion.

08:34.870 --> 08:36.160
There was a great deal of it,

08:36.280 --> 08:38.650
so I thought I would gather it all together and bury it.

08:38.730 --> 08:39.400
Wait a minute!

08:39.540 --> 08:41.170
Those are my secret safes!

08:41.290 --> 08:42.180
Don't pile them together!

08:43.860 --> 08:45.320
Well, why don't we do this?

08:45.520 --> 08:49.110
Find the most valuable item in these safes!

08:49.260 --> 08:50.330
What is this?

08:50.440 --> 08:52.180
You call that a contest?

08:52.260 --> 08:53.470
Right! It's not!

08:53.660 --> 08:56.010
What are you doing with my privacy?!

08:56.270 --> 08:57.380
I accept!

08:57.770 --> 09:00.770
I have no interest in the personal effects of some big pervert, but...

09:01.150 --> 09:03.450
You just decided that to spite me!

09:03.580 --> 09:04.800
Not at all!

09:05.910 --> 09:08.370
Well, Seiichirou-kun, will you be our judge?

09:09.040 --> 09:09.890
Hey, wh-why am I...?

09:10.120 --> 09:12.060
Oh, you were here, Seiichirou-kun?

09:12.170 --> 09:13.080
Of course I was!

09:13.410 --> 09:15.740
You three are no longer Yoshitaka's maids!

09:16.120 --> 09:17.560
Hasn't this gone far enough, Izumi-san!

09:17.770 --> 09:20.470
You shouldn't be this concerned about the mansion!

09:20.980 --> 09:22.510
It's all right, Seiichirou-kun.

09:22.840 --> 09:26.940
I intend to return to you even if I win this match.

09:27.450 --> 09:27.980
R-Really?

09:28.110 --> 09:28.860
In that case...

09:29.080 --> 09:30.950
Then the contest is all set!

09:31.080 --> 09:33.710
But Mitsuki, isn't this almost relying purely on chance?

09:33.930 --> 09:34.420
Yeah!

09:34.630 --> 09:36.820
So the contest is more like eeny-meeny-miney-moe!

09:37.260 --> 09:41.470
But I think you know Yoshitaka-kun better than Takami-san does,

09:41.670 --> 09:43.010
so you might have an advantage!

09:43.420 --> 09:45.410
So the rest is up to you, Onee-chan!

09:48.250 --> 09:52.290
But all of this is stuff Yoshitaka had stored away, isn't it?

09:52.730 --> 09:55.750
What am I going to do if there are things unsafe for virgin eyes?

09:57.760 --> 09:58.720
What could that be?

09:59.010 --> 10:00.620
It doesn't seem to be smoke, but...

10:04.300 --> 10:06.710
I guess Takami-san doesn't notice it.

10:10.470 --> 10:11.240
What could it be?

10:11.490 --> 10:12.560
Ok, now I'm curious.

10:14.480 --> 10:16.760
Knowing the rebellious, idiotic nature of Yoshitaka,

10:16.870 --> 10:21.180
I have figured he would put his precious items in this, the largest safe.

10:21.420 --> 10:21.840
Shut up!

10:21.860 --> 10:22.680
Don't decide that on your own!

10:22.950 --> 10:25.610
Be amazed by my flawless profiling ability

10:25.700 --> 10:29.510
and the good luck that would find a diamond in the desert!

10:30.780 --> 10:31.630
Now, open it!

10:31.890 --> 10:32.900
Why am I...

10:33.120 --> 10:35.020
There's no point if I can't open it!

10:35.130 --> 10:36.000
Damn it...

10:36.510 --> 10:36.970
Hey, what?

10:37.180 --> 10:37.960
What is it?

10:38.070 --> 10:40.210
This... isn't my safe.

10:44.210 --> 10:45.570
What's with this hippopotamus?

10:45.670 --> 10:47.020
I told you, Pochi is an alligator!

10:47.170 --> 10:47.900
Get off me!

10:51.780 --> 10:52.970
Wh-What's the meaning of this?

10:53.150 --> 10:56.430
That's Pochi's favorite save data from his girl simulation games.

10:57.060 --> 10:58.130
Which means...

10:58.460 --> 11:00.600
This safe was Pochi's!

11:01.040 --> 11:02.220
He's just an alligator...

11:02.740 --> 11:04.070
Pochi looks so happy!

11:04.470 --> 11:06.140
It's been so long since I've seen him like that!

11:06.390 --> 11:11.190
I don't want to believe it, but could this be the reason Pochi wanted to come back here?

11:11.330 --> 11:12.000
No way!

11:12.440 --> 11:14.320
Well, now it's Onee-chan's turn!

11:14.430 --> 11:16.540
Once again, you ended up picking something boring, didn't you?

11:16.830 --> 11:19.800
Was it too much of a bother to pick something suitable?

11:20.280 --> 11:22.230
I think I picked the right one, but...

11:22.540 --> 11:24.800
Mitsuki-chan and the mansion are on the line!

11:25.060 --> 11:26.780
Is this all right, Izumi-san?

11:27.120 --> 11:29.280
Why doesn't anyone notice this?

11:30.500 --> 11:32.760
Wait a minute, Izumi, th-that safe is...

11:32.990 --> 11:34.150
Please, any one but that one!

11:34.540 --> 11:36.470
I-It's all over if they see that!

11:36.760 --> 11:38.330
Well, let's open it!

11:39.160 --> 11:40.330
B-But like I said, why am I...

11:40.600 --> 11:41.750
Suck it up!

11:41.870 --> 11:42.670
Hurry up and open it!

11:43.780 --> 11:46.810
If we need to draw a mosaic or something over it, don't bring it out!

11:43.780 --> 11:46.810
Japan censors the genitals in domestically-sold pornography, hence the reference.

11:47.850 --> 11:51.780
<i>It's obvious that a man like him would never treasure something decent.</i>

11:52.100 --> 11:55.650
I-If it's really something that can't be shown to others, then...

11:56.280 --> 11:57.900
I-It's certainly possible...

12:18.310 --> 12:20.260
Did Yoshitaka make this himself?

12:20.510 --> 12:22.150
It's an elaborate wedding dress!

12:23.190 --> 12:28.050
I can't believe that Yoshitaka had enough imagination to make something as lyrical as this...

12:28.200 --> 12:30.220
This is an interesting twist!

12:30.670 --> 12:32.860
This isn't anything to be embarrassed about!

12:33.060 --> 12:35.230
He just made something pretty!

12:36.380 --> 12:39.520
The image of a perverted, self-indulgent lowlife I that made for myself is...

12:40.210 --> 12:42.130
It's not <i>that</i> nice of a dress.

12:42.350 --> 12:44.120
Hey, hey. Try it on, Onee-chan!

12:44.310 --> 12:44.820
Huh?

12:44.820 --> 12:46.370
Why should I?

12:46.480 --> 12:47.650
Just do it! Just do it!

12:50.840 --> 12:52.490
It's wonderful, Izumi-san!

12:53.040 --> 12:53.660
Yeah, It's pretty!

12:53.790 --> 12:55.160
The size is perfect.

12:55.450 --> 12:57.870
It's almost like the fabric is sticking to my sk-

12:58.010 --> 12:58.660
Don't tell me...!

12:59.200 --> 13:00.010
That's right.

13:00.320 --> 13:02.520
So I would be ready if Izumi changed her mind someday.

13:02.520 --> 13:02.950
What?

13:02.950 --> 13:05.140
Just as I thought. It was just for Onee-chan, right?

13:05.400 --> 13:05.980
<i>Yes.</i>

13:06.160 --> 13:08.860
<i>At first glance, I can tell that the clothes are not a set size.</i>

13:09.100 --> 13:12.220
<i>They're made to bring out Izumi-san to the fullest!</i>

13:12.590 --> 13:13.450
<i>The size is a given.</i>

13:13.720 --> 13:16.230
<i>But to suit her so well after just trying it on</i>

13:16.390 --> 13:18.580
<i>means he has also perfected his image training!</i>

13:18.940 --> 13:19.520
I understand.

13:19.790 --> 13:23.280
I understand... The only one who can truly comprehend the value of this dress

13:23.420 --> 13:25.970
is one who is of the same inclination as him, me!

13:26.450 --> 13:27.300
<i>Damn it!</i>

13:28.450 --> 13:32.910
Izumi

13:29.020 --> 13:30.080
Izumi-san wins!

13:30.220 --> 13:31.880
Why is it my loss?

13:31.990 --> 13:33.040
That's not fair, not fair!

13:33.400 --> 13:34.750
Its just as hard for me.

13:34.950 --> 13:37.450
But this is nothing more than the conclusion of an impartial judge!

13:37.940 --> 13:40.610
There's not a single flaw in this decision!

13:44.650 --> 13:46.900
Now then, the deed to this mansion.

13:47.740 --> 13:48.940
Here, Izumi-san.

13:52.950 --> 13:53.860
Onee-chan!

13:54.070 --> 13:54.660
Mitsuki!

13:55.060 --> 13:58.330
I won't allow anything to be taken from me!

13:58.700 --> 13:59.760
Don't screw with us!

14:00.530 --> 14:01.510
You need to help too!

14:01.610 --> 14:03.270
Ah, wait! Stop! That's dangerous!

14:03.390 --> 14:04.020
Wait!

14:05.830 --> 14:06.360
Jeez...

14:06.960 --> 14:08.090
Onee-chan!

14:08.320 --> 14:09.120
Mitsuki!

14:10.910 --> 14:11.850
I'm sorry, Yoshitaka!

14:14.870 --> 14:15.640
Wait!

14:15.970 --> 14:16.620
I-Izumi?

14:19.150 --> 14:21.750
Waaaiiit!

14:22.230 --> 14:23.840
Th-That's incredible, Izumi-san!

14:28.240 --> 14:29.730
What are you doing at a time like this?!

14:29.930 --> 14:32.650
Think you can keep up with Kashiharagou, who's praised as a fast horse?

14:32.770 --> 14:34.280
Go ahead and try!

14:35.480 --> 14:36.920
Izumi-san, over here!

14:37.120 --> 14:37.740
Anna-chan!

14:40.220 --> 14:41.430
Thank you, Anna-chan.

14:41.790 --> 14:43.200
It's fine! Don't worry about it!

14:44.040 --> 14:49.080
When you were angry at me, I thought I might give it a shot and not run away.

14:49.280 --> 14:51.840
Oh? Did I say something?

14:53.430 --> 14:56.470
I can't believe you followed me on a hippopotamus. You must have lost your mind!

14:56.750 --> 14:58.140
I told you. Pochi's an alligator.

14:59.290 --> 15:03.120
I-I will not... lose in a place like this!

15:07.910 --> 15:08.760
She's gone!

15:09.120 --> 15:09.780
Over here!

15:11.850 --> 15:12.590
Onee-chan!

15:12.860 --> 15:13.780
How could this happen?

15:20.190 --> 15:20.790
Mitsuki!

15:21.030 --> 15:21.820
Onee-chan!

15:22.510 --> 15:23.720
You just keep doing idiotic things!

15:23.970 --> 15:25.840
You need to think about what you're doing once and a while!

15:25.840 --> 15:26.520
Right.

15:26.970 --> 15:28.400
Thank you, Onee-chan!

15:29.910 --> 15:32.730
Izumi-san, I want to touch you too!

15:33.830 --> 15:34.530
A-Anna-chan!

15:44.240 --> 15:46.750
I'll accept it. That was my loss, Izumi-san.

15:47.040 --> 15:49.840
You've got some nerve to say that after going off like that!

15:50.740 --> 15:53.250
For a stupid older sister who doesn't understand the value of her little sister,

15:53.350 --> 15:54.050
you're pretty full of yourself.

15:54.330 --> 15:57.680
If you didn't have Mitsuki-san's producing talent during your debut,

15:57.810 --> 16:00.210
you would have stopped at being an unmarketable net-idol!

16:00.420 --> 16:02.300
I-I wasn't really...

16:02.910 --> 16:06.250
Mitsuki made me an idol before I knew it.

16:08.100 --> 16:10.920
Why do you know so much about me, Takami-san?

16:11.010 --> 16:12.730
That <i>is </i>excessively detailed...

16:13.820 --> 16:18.300
That's because Takami-san was Onee-chan's rival!

16:18.630 --> 16:19.410
Rival?

16:19.500 --> 16:19.990
Yeah!

16:20.200 --> 16:21.430
As a net-idol!

16:21.760 --> 16:27.430
The concert in the southern islands was supposed to be a recital for Takami-san, but I snatched it away.

16:28.070 --> 16:31.260
I completely forgot about that as well...

16:31.400 --> 16:32.050
Hey!

16:32.090 --> 16:33.350
Don't talk about those things so lightly!

16:34.700 --> 16:38.470
You were really lucky that you couldn't get a hold of Mitsuki!

16:39.200 --> 16:42.620
You can't just become her older sister overnight!

16:43.160 --> 16:45.340
I'm prepared to do so anytime!

16:46.970 --> 16:50.510
So... why are you making us wear these outfits again?!

16:50.710 --> 16:51.770
Honestly, that's...

16:51.990 --> 16:54.290
But we didn't have any other clothes to wear!

16:54.440 --> 16:55.680
Don't tell me he just made these!

16:55.830 --> 16:57.370
Isn't that great, Yoshitaka-kun?

16:57.460 --> 16:58.730
You got your mansion back!

16:59.410 --> 17:01.310
It's all thanks to Izumi-san.

17:01.420 --> 17:02.930
Be grateful to her!

17:03.520 --> 17:05.690
Yeah, it's just as Anna-chan says.

17:06.800 --> 17:08.720
Well, Izumi, this house belongs to you.

17:08.850 --> 17:10.750
Wh-What are you saying, all of a sudden?

17:11.180 --> 17:14.600
I was able to take this house back because you put forth such great effort.

17:14.890 --> 17:18.950
So... from this day forward, you'll be the master of this house, Izumi-san.

17:19.200 --> 17:20.680
What is this nonsense?

17:21.060 --> 17:24.200
This is the house your father and mother went to great pains to leave you.

17:24.440 --> 17:26.360
You have to treasure it!

17:26.670 --> 17:33.240
I used to think that searching for a place that suited you might be something to be treasured,

17:33.460 --> 17:37.440
but now I wonder if working hard in a single place might not make it more precious.

17:37.870 --> 17:41.480
Then this house suits you that much more.

17:42.090 --> 17:45.100
I wasn't the one working hard to maintain it. It was you.

17:45.430 --> 17:48.210
Wh-What's wrong with you? You're creeping me out!

17:48.870 --> 17:50.190
I said there's nothing wrong.

17:50.710 --> 17:52.420
There are my true feelings.

17:52.620 --> 17:53.240
Now look here!

17:53.670 --> 17:57.710
Don't be all docile just because people are trying to get along!

17:57.950 --> 17:59.150
You're Yoshitaka, aren't you?

17:59.440 --> 18:02.830
You're the greedy, perverted moron who is my master, right?

18:03.220 --> 18:05.060
What did you... call me?

18:05.210 --> 18:06.540
A greedy, perverted moron.

18:07.210 --> 18:07.880
No, after that.

18:08.090 --> 18:10.950
A greedy, perverted moron who is my master!

18:11.050 --> 18:12.300
Yeah, say that one more time!

18:12.550 --> 18:14.650
I'm not going to say it over and over!

18:14.800 --> 18:20.070
I said that this useless moron otaku scum of a man is my master!

18:20.590 --> 18:21.870
Then put that in writing here.

18:22.590 --> 18:23.960
I have a pen and your hanko here!

18:24.450 --> 18:25.070
Ah, thanks.

18:30.790 --> 18:31.450
At last!

18:32.170 --> 18:35.820
At last, you have recognized me as your master, Izumi!

18:36.000 --> 18:37.660
Wh-What's wrong, Yoshitaka?

18:37.930 --> 18:39.470
What are you talking about? What's going on here?

18:39.770 --> 18:43.240
I've already received your mother's blessing.

18:42.930 --> 18:45.470
Parental Consent Form

18:43.550 --> 18:45.610
There are no more legal loopholes to slip through!

18:47.720 --> 18:48.170
Mitsuki?

18:48.230 --> 18:49.250
That was magnificent!

18:49.710 --> 18:52.080
This contest belongs to Master!

18:52.220 --> 18:53.430
M-Mitsuki?

18:53.720 --> 18:54.370
What happened?

18:54.660 --> 18:56.180
What do you mean by contest?

18:56.290 --> 18:57.550
It was something nice I did for him.

18:57.840 --> 19:02.330
It happened when you, me, and Pochi were going to leave the house.

19:04.590 --> 19:06.550
Let's have a contest, Yoshitaka-kun!

19:06.800 --> 19:07.460
A contest?

19:07.680 --> 19:08.120
Yes!

19:08.330 --> 19:10.990
We're going to leave this house.

19:11.250 --> 19:15.100
So please take us back once again!

19:15.330 --> 19:15.840
That's all there is.

19:16.250 --> 19:17.200
Simple, right?

19:17.490 --> 19:20.070
Take you back... How in the world am I supposed to do <i>that</i>?

19:23.790 --> 19:26.910
In other words... I can use any method I want, right?

19:27.150 --> 19:28.010
Of course!

19:28.250 --> 19:30.320
It wouldn't be interesting if you didn't!

19:30.690 --> 19:31.310
What do you think?

19:31.520 --> 19:32.360
Will you do it?

19:32.730 --> 19:33.720
Of course!

19:34.160 --> 19:36.240
That's why you're Yoshitaka-kun, all right!

19:36.690 --> 19:37.460
...and that's what happened!

19:37.890 --> 19:39.100
Wh-What was all of that?!

19:39.330 --> 19:41.960
You mean <i>you</i> put me through all that stuff until now?!

19:42.220 --> 19:42.810
Naive.

19:43.090 --> 19:44.050
You're so naive, Izumi!

19:44.350 --> 19:47.150
I prepared myself to lose everything for the sake of this moment!

19:48.280 --> 19:50.490
I'm not actually going to associate myself with someone like this.

19:50.700 --> 19:56.180
The-Then... you being in the hospital, your bankruptcy... was that real?

19:56.380 --> 19:57.220
Well, now.

19:57.600 --> 19:59.230
Thanks to you, I've been through a lot.

19:59.380 --> 20:06.200
But I would gladly make any sacrifice to retrieve my highly valued middle school maids!

20:06.470 --> 20:08.120
Th-That's too dramatic!

20:08.580 --> 20:12.040
B-But if I hadn't worried about you...

20:12.370 --> 20:14.500
No, but you came.

20:14.850 --> 20:15.650
In other words...

20:15.970 --> 20:16.890
IT'S MY VICTORY!

20:17.360 --> 20:18.190
No way...

20:18.570 --> 20:19.820
Then that means...

20:21.540 --> 20:23.120
My 10,000,000 yen vase!

20:23.380 --> 20:25.220
Wh-What the hell?!

20:24.320 --> 20:24.950
How?

20:25.680 --> 20:28.230
How can you go so far, Yoshitaka?

20:28.520 --> 20:30.240
If you really want to get something,

20:30.540 --> 20:32.320
you employ every method available to you!

20:32.810 --> 20:34.910
Why don't you give up and admit your loss?!

20:35.380 --> 20:36.730
Equivalent trade, huh?

20:36.950 --> 20:38.330
It hurts, but I will accept it.

20:38.800 --> 20:41.960
Your feelings towards Izumi, are without a doubt, love!

20:42.300 --> 20:42.880
Huh?!

20:43.310 --> 20:46.770
In the end, I couldn't even keep Izumi-san with me.

20:47.170 --> 20:50.090
But, Yoshitaka... no matter how much love you have,

20:50.480 --> 20:54.780
you can't call it <i>true</i> love until you consider Izumi-san's feelings!

20:56.040 --> 20:56.850
That's fine with me!

20:57.070 --> 20:59.930
Who'd wish for a happy family life at a time like this?!

21:00.200 --> 21:01.340
I've seen the light.

21:01.570 --> 21:04.150
While I was fighting for warmth, shivering from the cold, sipping muddy water...

21:04.350 --> 21:09.880
My soul's repose will never be found in tranquility!

21:10.560 --> 21:12.210
Master, you're so funny!

21:12.330 --> 21:13.900
Wh-Who's got a family life?!

21:14.210 --> 21:15.490
Damn it! No, no, no!

21:15.680 --> 21:17.660
I can't give Izumi-san to someone like this after all!

21:17.900 --> 21:20.130
Your love isn't beautiful at all!

21:20.990 --> 21:22.710
You think I need that kind of boring love?

21:22.830 --> 21:25.610
As long as I have a contract and a debt to lean on, that's fine with me!

21:25.730 --> 21:27.640
He's saying some impressively idiotic things that I don't understand.

21:27.790 --> 21:30.880
He's been incredibly busy in order to bring his deviancy to this level.

21:31.510 --> 21:32.980
A-As if...

21:33.690 --> 21:35.540
THAT'S GOING TO HAPPEN!!!

21:36.090 --> 21:37.170
That's right, Izumi!

21:38.150 --> 21:39.110
You have nothing to fear from your debt!

21:39.480 --> 21:40.140
Dad!

21:40.370 --> 21:43.680
Your father has come up with an epoch-beginning idea, so you can relax now!

21:44.120 --> 21:44.940
And that is...

21:45.300 --> 21:46.030
TO STEAL YOU AWAY IN THE NIGHT!

21:46.290 --> 21:47.250
But it's the middle of the day!

21:47.500 --> 21:49.270
I should have done this from the start!

21:50.050 --> 21:50.840
Mom?

21:50.900 --> 21:51.370
Mihuzo...

21:51.950 --> 21:53.150
Wh-Why?

21:53.340 --> 21:56.880
Don't make the situation more difficult, honey.

21:56.990 --> 22:00.590
Onee-chans, are you two maids at Yoshitaka-kun's place again?

22:01.160 --> 22:02.250
I'm sorry, Karin.

22:02.420 --> 22:03.470
Onee-chan...

22:03.630 --> 22:04.180
It's all right.

22:04.460 --> 22:08.290
You look like you're having a lot of fun when you're at Yoshitaka-kun's house!

22:09.770 --> 22:11.280
R-Really?

22:14.770 --> 22:17.560
Everything's back to normal now, right, Onee-chan?

22:17.750 --> 22:19.480
What in the world was all that hard work for?

22:19.960 --> 22:23.300
Just as I thought. I can't be satisfied with a long dress on my bride!

22:23.680 --> 22:25.860
I was confused about that. No doubt about it!

22:26.030 --> 22:26.910
It's obvious!

22:27.580 --> 22:30.720
見た目の甘さほどは

22:27.580 --> 22:30.720
They only appear sweet for a moment,

22:27.580 --> 22:30.720
mitame no amasa hodo ha

22:30.870 --> 22:34.510
儚いとか 弱くもないから

22:30.870 --> 22:34.510
and they're not weak either.

22:30.870 --> 22:34.510
hakanai to ka yowaku mo nai kara

22:34.670 --> 22:39.640
女の子は結構 頑丈よ

22:34.670 --> 22:39.640
Girls are pretty stable.

22:34.670 --> 22:39.640
onnanoko ha kekkou ganjou yo

22:35.750 --> 22:36.310
There we go.

22:36.720 --> 22:37.860
Onee-chan!

22:39.130 --> 22:40.380
What's going on, everyone?

22:40.850 --> 22:42.900
Izumi-san, what are <i>you</i> doing?

22:41.720 --> 22:44.840
つつぱるほど 折れそになる

22:41.720 --> 22:44.840
Otherwise I would break from becoming friends.

22:41.720 --> 22:44.840
tsutsu paru hodo oresō ni naru

22:43.260 --> 22:44.930
What did you plant, Onee-chan?

22:45.010 --> 22:48.670
駆け引きさえ時にはいいよネ！

22:45.010 --> 22:48.670
Right, sometimes it's even a good bargain!!

22:45.010 --> 22:48.670
kakehiki sae tokiniha ī yo ne

22:45.510 --> 22:46.210
Well...

22:46.590 --> 22:50.010
It's the seedling that the wind carried into my room earlier.

22:48.780 --> 22:53.800
涙なら辛口エッセンス

22:48.780 --> 22:53.800
If the tears essence is spicy...

22:48.780 --> 22:53.800
namidanara karakuchi essensu

22:50.680 --> 22:53.870
But I don't think it's really anything important.

22:54.170 --> 22:55.850
For you to do something like that...

22:54.290 --> 22:55.850
機器 って な ある?

22:54.290 --> 22:55.850
is it all right?

22:54.290 --> 22:55.850
kiki tte na aru?

22:56.190 --> 23:02.110
ルールとるこだわると見えない神秘

22:56.190 --> 23:02.110
Strangely, I'm not obsessed with the rules.

22:56.190 --> 23:02.110
rūru toru kodawaru to mienai shinpi

22:56.540 --> 22:59.290
Izumi-san, you plan on staying in this house from now on...

23:02.420 --> 23:09.780
ポケットの奥でいつも いたい 言って いる

23:02.420 --> 23:09.780
I saying I want to stay in this pocket.

23:02.420 --> 23:09.780
poketto no oku de itsumo itai itte iru

23:05.330 --> 23:07.150
You two try this as well.

23:07.600 --> 23:09.430
It feels great!

23:09.930 --> 23:16.590
はしゃいで華やいでパワーをチャージして

23:09.930 --> 23:16.590
Charge your power by being merry, being brilliant.

23:09.930 --> 23:16.590
hashaide hanayaide pawā o chāji shite

23:16.930 --> 23:23.460
明るい未来とか前向き作りましょう

23:16.930 --> 23:23.460
Let's make a bright prospective future.

23:16.930 --> 23:23.460
akarui mirai toka maemuki tsukurimashou

23:22.140 --> 23:23.530
IZUMI!

23:24.020 --> 23:30.790
内緒にしてたケド分かるでしょ？本当は

23:24.020 --> 23:30.790
I had kept it a secret, but I know the truth.

23:24.020 --> 23:30.790
naisho ni shi tetakedo wakarudesho hontōha

23:24.440 --> 23:25.510
WHAT THE HELL IS THIS?!

23:25.670 --> 23:27.340
I-It wasn't me!

23:27.520 --> 23:28.440
Wh-Why did it...?

23:29.110 --> 23:31.120
Onee-chan, your dream came true!

23:31.110 --> 23:38.040
世界を変えるのは愛情と女の子

23:31.110 --> 23:38.040
Girls and love can change the world.

23:31.110 --> 23:38.040
sekai o kaeru no wa aijō to on'nanoko

23:31.250 --> 23:32.740
It's incredible, Izumi-san!

23:32.890 --> 23:34.110
This is going on your debt!

23:34.300 --> 23:34.890
That's it.

23:35.140 --> 23:35.660
It's a dream!

23:35.900 --> 23:36.860
This is a dream!

23:37.360 --> 23:39.340
SAVE ME, GOD!

23:39.680 --> 23:43.310
The End

23:40.470 --> 23:43.260
Izumi's Debt from Today

23:46.050 --> 23:46.670
Hey, everyone!

23:46.860 --> 23:50.610
How was it? Did you manage to enjoy the activities?

23:51.390 --> 23:52.450
It's over! It's over!

23:52.890 --> 23:54.900
It was really tiring.

23:55.240 --> 23:56.420
I think I pulled a muscle.

23:56.510 --> 23:57.760
Good work, Onee-chan!

23:57.870 --> 23:58.750
So, Mitsuki...

23:58.980 --> 24:01.750
from here on out we are going to become normal girls.

24:01.880 --> 24:05.890
Oh, don't say that. We had a lot of fun.

24:06.130 --> 24:06.550
Huh?

24:06.630 --> 24:07.790
It's ok!

24:07.940 --> 24:09.160
That's right, Izumi-san

24:09.530 --> 24:14.430
From here on out, in a place where no one else can observe, we will take advantage of our situation.

24:15.620 --> 24:19.470
Now wait a minute! That is no different from the way things were before!

24:19.570 --> 24:20.560
You're too naive, Izumi.

24:22.200 --> 24:25.190
In a place where there are no cameras...

24:25.720 --> 24:28.650
I, of course, get to capture everything for myself.

24:28.800 --> 24:31.570
What do you guys think? Are you jealous?

24:33.360 --> 24:36.060
You are jealous, aren't you?! Ha!

24:36.270 --> 24:38.760
He is a guy whose rudeness knows no bounds.

24:39.150 --> 24:44.210
Well in that case, if no one is viewing, I am not going to restrain myself!

24:46.520 --> 24:50.050
Don't restrain yourself with me either!

24:50.450 --> 24:51.030
What?

24:51.860 --> 24:52.260
Hey wai-

24:52.340 --> 24:55.690
There are still lots of interesting things to come!

24:56.130 --> 24:57.160
Look forward to it.
